<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Юми кофе — Больше, чем просто кофе</title>
<style>
    /* ===== БАЗОВЫЕ СБРОСЫ И ПЕРЕМЕННЫЕ ===== */
    * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    :root {
        --bg-dark: #1a1410;
        --bg-medium: #2d1f15;
        --bg-card: #3e2a1f;
        --accent: #c89b6c;
        --accent-light: #d4a574;
        --text: #f5ebdc;
        --text-soft: #a67c52;
        --border: rgba(200, 155, 108, 0.2);
    }

    html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
        font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
        background-color: var(--bg-dark);
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* ===== НАВИГАЦИЯ ===== */
    nav {
        background-color: rgba(26, 20, 16, 0.95);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        padding: 18px 40px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 16px;
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 100;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    nav .logo {
        color: var(--text);
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    nav .logo span {
        color: var(--accent);
        font-style: italic;
    }

    nav ul {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        gap: 28px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    nav ul a {
        color: var(--text);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        transition: color 0.2s;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    nav ul a:hover {
        color: var(--accent);
    }

    .nav-btn {
        background-color: var(--accent);
        color: var(--bg-dark);
        padding: 10px 24px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        transition: background-color 0.2s;
    }

    .nav-btn:hover {
        background-color: var(--accent-light);
    }

    section {
        padding: 80px 40px;
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    h1, h2, h3 {
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
        color: var(--text);
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    h2 .accent {
        color: var(--accent);
        font-style: italic;
    }

    .section-subtitle {
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--text-soft);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        margin-bottom: 50px;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .section-label {
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* ===== HERO ===== */
    .hero {
        background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(26, 20, 16, 0.7), rgba(26, 20, 16, 0.85)), url('img/shop.jpg');
        background-size: cover;
        background-position: center;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        color: var(--text);
        padding: 160px 40px;
        max-width: none;
        margin: 0;
        text-align: left;
    }

    .hero-inner {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .hero-label {
        color: var(--accent);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        letter-spacing: 3px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .hero h1 {
        font-size: 4.5rem;
        line-height: 1.1;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        color: var(--text);
    }

    .hero h1 .accent {
        color: var(--accent);
        font-style: italic;
    }

    .hero p {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
        color: var(--text);
        opacity: 0.9;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .hero-buttons {
        display: flex;
        gap: 16px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 14px 32px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 1rem;
        border-radius: 4px;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        transition: all 0.2s;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .btn-primary {
        background-color: var(--accent);
        color: var(--bg-dark);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
        background-color: var(--accent-light);
    }

    .btn-outline {
        background-color: transparent;
        color: var(--text);
        border: 2px solid var(--text);
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
        background-color: var(--text);
        color: var(--bg-dark);
    }

    .hero-features {
        display: flex;
        gap: 40px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .hero-feature {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .hero-feature-icon {
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        border: 1px solid var(--accent);
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .hero-feature-text strong {
        display: block;
        color: var(--text);
        margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .hero-feature-text span {
        color: var(--text-soft);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    /* ===== FEATURED DRINKS ===== */
    .featured {
        background-color: var(--bg-medium);
        max-width: none;
        padding: 80px 40px;
    }

    .featured-inner {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .featured-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
        gap: 24px;
        margin-top: 40px;
    }

    .featured-card {
        background-color: var(--bg-card);
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        position: relative;
    }

    .featured-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .featured-card-img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 240px;
        object-fit: cover;
        display: block;
    }

    .featured-card-heart {
        position: absolute;
        top: 16px;
        right: 16px;
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        background-color: rgba(26, 20, 16, 0.7);
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: var(--text);
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background-color 0.2s;
    }

    .featured-card-heart:hover {
        background-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .featured-card-content {
        padding: 24px;
    }

    .featured-card-name {
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        color: var(--text);
    }

    .featured-card-desc {
        color: var(--text-soft);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .featured-card-price {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: var(--accent);
        color: var(--bg-dark);
        padding: 6px 16px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    /* ===== OUR STORY ===== */
    .story {
        background-color: var(--bg-dark);
    }

    .story-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 60px;
        align-items: center;
        margin-top: 40px;
    }

    .story-img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 400px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .story-content h3 {
        font-size: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .story-content h3 .accent {
        color: var(--accent);
        font-style: italic;
    }

    .story-content p {
        color: var(--text);
        opacity: 0.85;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* ===== MENU ===== */
    .menu-section {
        background-color: var(--bg-medium);
        max-width: none;
        padding: 80px 40px;
    }

    .menu-inner {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .menu-tabs {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 8px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .menu-tab {
        background: none;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 12px 28px;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: var(--text-soft);
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.2s;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .menu-tab:hover {
        border-color: var(--accent);
        color: var(--text);
    }

    .menu-tab.active {
        background-color: var(--accent);
        color: var(--bg-dark);
        border-color: var(--accent);
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .menu-category {
        margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .menu-category h3 {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        color: var(--text);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding-bottom: 12px;
    }

    /* ===== СЕТКА МЕНЮ В ДВА СТОЛБИКА ===== */
    .menu-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 0 40px;
    }

    .menu-item {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 20px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        transition: background-color 0.2s;
    }

    .menu-item:hover {
        background-color: rgba(200, 155, 108, 0.05);
        padding-left: 16px;
        padding-right: 16px;
        margin: 0 -16px;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .menu-item-info {
        flex: 1;
    }

    .menu-item-name {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--text);
        margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .menu-item-volume {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--text-soft);
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .menu-item-dots {
        flex: 1;
        border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--text-soft);
        margin: 0 20px;
        opacity: 0.3;
    }

    .menu-item-price {
        font-weight: bold;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        white-space: nowrap;
        background-color: rgba(200, 155, 108, 0.15);
        padding: 6px 16px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .menu-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        padding: 3px 8px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        color: white;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-left: 10px;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .menu-badge.new {
        background-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .menu-badge.hit {
        background-color: var(--accent-light);
    }

    /* ===== REVIEWS ===== */
    .reviews {
        background-color: var(--bg-dark);
    }

    .reviews-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
        gap: 24px;
        margin-top: 40px;
    }

    .review-card {
        background-color: var(--bg-card);
        padding: 32px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .review-stars {
        color: var(--accent);
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .review-text {
        color: var(--text);
        font-style: italic;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .review-author {
        color: var(--text-soft);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    /* ===== CTA ===== */
    .cta {
        background-color: var(--bg-medium);
        max-width: none;
        padding: 80px 40px;
    }

    .cta-inner {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .cta h2 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .cta p {
        color: var(--text);
        opacity: 0.85;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .cta-buttons {
        display: flex;
        gap: 16px;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* ===== ADDRESS & CONTACTS ===== */
    .info-section {
        background-color: var(--bg-dark);
    }

    .info-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
        gap: 40px;
        margin-top: 40px;
    }

    .info-card {
        background-color: var(--bg-card);
        padding: 32px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .info-card h3 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        color: var(--accent);
    }

    .info-card p {
        color: var(--text);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .info-card a {
        color: var(--accent);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .info-card a:hover {
        color: var(--accent-light);
    }

    /* ===== ИНТЕРАКТИВНАЯ КАРТА 2GIS (всегда открыта) ===== */
    .map-container {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
        margin-top: 20px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background-color: var(--bg-card);
    }

    .map-wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 600px;
        background-color: #2a2018;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        position: relative;
    }

    .map-wrapper iframe {
        width: 100%;
        height: 600px;
        display: block;
        border: 0;
    }

    .map-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 14px 28px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: all 0.25s;
        cursor: pointer;
        border: none;
    }

    /* ===== КНОПКИ МАРШРУТА РЯДОМ ===== */
    .map-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 20px;
        background-color: var(--bg-card);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
    }

    .map-btn-outline {
        background-color: transparent;
        color: var(--text);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .map-btn-outline:hover {
        border-color: var(--accent);
        color: var(--accent);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .map-info {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 16px;
        color: var(--text-soft);
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .map-info strong {
        color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* ===== FOOTER ===== */
    footer {
        background-color: var(--bg-dark);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        color: var(--text-soft);
        text-align: center;
        padding: 30px 20px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    /* ===== АДАПТИВНОСТЬ ===== */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
        .hero h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; }
        .story-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
        .hero { padding: 100px 20px; }
        section { padding: 60px 20px; }
        h2 { font-size: 2rem; }
        nav { padding: 14px 20px; }
        nav ul { gap: 16px; }
        .hero-features { gap: 20px; }
        .featured, .menu-section, .cta { padding: 60px 20px; }
        .map-wrapper iframe { height: 400px; }
        .map-actions { flex-direction: column; }
        .map-btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
        /* На мобильных меню в одну колонку */
        .menu-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
        .hero-buttons { flex-direction: column; }
        .btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- НАВИГАЦИЯ -->
<nav>
    <div class="logo">Юми <span>кофе</span></div>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="#home">Главная</a></li>
        <li><a href="#menu">Меню</a></li>
        <li><a href="#story">О нас</a></li>
        <li><a href="#reviews">Отзывы</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contacts">Контакты</a></li>
    </ul>
    <a href="#menu" class="nav-btn">Посмотреть меню →</a>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-label">— Премиальный кофейный опыт —</div>
        <h1>Больше, чем кофе,<br>Это <span class="accent">ежедневный ритуал</span></h1>
        <p>Свежий кофе, горячие напитки и домашние десерты. Уютное пространство, где каждый день начинается с отличного настроения.</p>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="#menu" class="btn btn-primary">Посмотреть меню →</a>
            <a href="#contacts" class="btn btn-outline">Забронировать столик</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-features">
            <div class="hero-feature">
                <div class="hero-feature-icon">☕</div>
                <div class="hero-feature-text">
                    <strong>Свежая обжарка</strong>
                    <span>Каждый день</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-feature">
                <div class="hero-feature-icon">👨‍🍳</div>
                <div class="hero-feature-text">
                    <strong>Мастера-бариста</strong>
                    <span>С душой к делу</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-feature">
                <div class="hero-feature-icon">🛋️</div>
                <div class="hero-feature-text">
                    <strong>Уютное пространство</strong>
                    <span>Для работы и встреч</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- FEATURED DRINKS -->
<section class="featured">
    <div class="featured-inner">
        <div class="section-label">— Любимые напитки —</div>
        <h2>Популярные <span class="accent">напитки</span></h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Ручная работа и сезонные новинки, созданные с любовью</p>
        <div class="featured-grid">
            <div class="featured-card">
                <img src="img/A3.png" alt="Латте" class="featured-card-img">
                <div class="featured-card-heart">♡</div>
                <div class="featured-card-content">
                    <h3 class="featured-card-name">Латте</h3>
                    <p class="featured-card-desc">Мягкий эспрессо, бархатистое молоко и нежная пенка</p>
                    <span class="featured-card-price">215 ₽</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="featured-card">
                <img src="img/A2.webp" alt="Кофе" class="featured-card-img">
                <div class="featured-card-heart">♡</div>
                <div class="featured-card-content">
                    <h3 class="featured-card-name">Капучино</h3>
                    <p class="featured-card-desc">Классический итальянский кофе с воздушной пенкой</p>
                    <span class="featured-card-price">190 ₽</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="featured-card">
                <img src="img/A1.jpg" alt="Напиток" class="featured-card-img">
                <div class="featured-card-heart">♡</div>
                <div class="featured-card-content">
                    <h3 class="featured-card-name">Матча-латте</h3>
                    <p class="featured-card-desc">Японский чай матча с молоком на выбор</p>
                    <span class="featured-card-price">220 ₽</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- OUR STORY -->
<section class="story" id="story">
    <div class="section-label">— Наша история —</div>
    <h2>Кофейня, построенная на <span class="accent">страсти и людях</span></h2>
    <div class="story-grid">
        <img src="img/A6.png" alt="Интерьер Юми кофе" class="story-img">
